OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm approved despite
OL,4,Acouncillors' concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have unanimously approved
OL,7,Fplans for a solar farm in
OL,8,FLeicestershire despite voicing concerns
OL,9,Fit was "not the right place" for it.
OL,11,FAt a planning committee meeting on
OL,12,FThursday councillors at Melton Borough
OL,13,FCouncil discussed proposals for the
OL,14,Fsolar farm on land east of Waltham
OL,15,FRoad, Freeby.
OL,17,FPreviously the applicant, Downing
OL,18,FRenewable Developments, said the
OL,19,Fdevelopment would produce up to 42 MW
OL,20,Fof renewable energy and could provide
OL,21,Fenough electricity to power about
OL,22,F10,000 homes.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
