OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm approved despite
OL,4,Acouncillors' concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the planning committee said
OL,7,Fchanges to the National Planning Policy
OL,8,FFramework meant they now had their
OL,9,Fhands "tied behind their back" when it
OL,10,Fcame to decisions about solar farms.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
